Hide
Curs Off
Palette $000,$FFF
Paper 0
Pen 1
Cls 0
Print "R roll   B bank   Q quit"
Clear Key
BR_K$=Upper$(Input$(1))
Print "Key: ";BR_K$
If BR_K$="R" Then Print "Roll requested."
If BR_K$="B" Then Print "Bank requested."
If BR_K$="Q" Then Print "Quit requested."
Print "No score changes in this program."
Clear Key
Wait Key
Show
End
